{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5d14d177-435c-8c1c-90f4-4a415494c20d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-21T11:44:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Julio Mejia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:41:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:41:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. So, I grew up down by the harbor, right, and every winter my uncle used to say the roads in this town were patched with chewing gum. Anyway, he was not wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:41:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha, okay. So is this about a road problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:41:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, a pothole. Well, it was a pothole. Somebody filled it with cold patch last week, and it already washed out. It's gone. It's a hole again, worse than before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:41:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a pothole that was filled last week and the patch is already gone. Where is it, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:41:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "397 Pelham Street. Right in front of the house, kind of at the edge of the road. And it's right in the bike lane, which is the dumb part. Somebody's going to go over their handlebars."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:42:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "397 Pelham Street, in the bike lane. Got it. Let me type that in. Is it a big one? Roughly how wide?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:42:13-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, like a dinner plate, maybe bigger. And deep. Sorry, hold on, I'm talking to my phone here. I just discovered voice typing and now I use it everywhere. I was texting my landlord about it before I called and it wrote something totally ridiculous."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:42:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] That's fine, I'm still here. So about the size of a dinner plate, maybe larger, and deep. Has anyone been hurt or had a tire damaged that you know of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:42:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I know of. I just see cars swerving into the other lane to miss it, and the bikes too. It's annoying, honestly. They were just here. One week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:42:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, cold patch in the winter doesn't always hold, especially with the water and the freezing and thawing. I'll put this in as a repeat repair so the crew knows it was already filled once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:43:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. Because otherwise they'll just dump another bucket of gravel in there and it'll wash out again by Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:43:08-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I'll note that the earlier patch failed. Let me read it back. Pothole, bike lane, in front of 397 Pelham Street, patched last week, patch washed out, about the size of a dinner plate or larger. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:43:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it. Can I get a reference number for that? So I can say I called."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:43:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hang on one second while it saves. [pause] Okay, it's coming up. Do you have a pen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:43:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, go ahead. Actually, wait, I'll just say it into my phone. Okay, go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:43:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your reference number is PW, dash, 4 2 1 7. That's P as in Peter, W as in William, then 4, 2, 1, 7."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:43:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P W, dash, four two one seven. Okay. Did it get that right? Let me look. Yeah, it did. Weird, it usually messes up numbers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:44:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Do you want a call back when it's scheduled, or just have the crew handle it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:44:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call back is fine. It's 401-555-0169."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:44:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0169. And that's Julio, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:44:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Julio Mejia, yeah. M-E-J-I-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:44:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Mr. Mejia. It should go on the repair list this week or next, depending on the weather. If it gets worse before then, call me back with that reference number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:44:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks. I appreciate it. Hopefully this one actually sticks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:44:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We'll do our best. Take care, now."
    }
  ],
